  "helpBody": "The 4 digits of the number are fixed planets, in order, along the route.\n\nTap a dock (between the planets), then tap an operator to place it there. Tap a placed token to remove it.\n\nUse the = sign exactly once. Neighboring planets with no operator between them form a larger number (1 and 2 become 12).\n\nFunctions like √( and floor( open a parenthesis: close it with ).\n\nEasy allows non-integer division; other levels allow exact division only.\n\nPoints: Easy 1, Intermediate 2, Advanced 3, Hard 5.",
